[[File:Useless Bird (Beta 31.0).png|thumb|198x198px|Beta 31.0]]
Useless Bird was added in '''Beta 30.0'''. It's named this way as it has Disarmed and adds two more randomly chosen Disarmed monsters to your hand (except for itself or a DT monster, specifically [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Chara Chara]). Like many other Deltarune cards, it was slightly changed in '''Beta 31.0'''. For Useless Bird, this meant a +1 buff in HP, from 3 to 4. With Chara's rework in Beta 31.2, '''Beta 32.0''' reworded the effect. It no longer has the DT limitation, but no DT monster has Disarmed anymore.
[[File:Useless Bird (Beta 32.0).png|thumb|196x196px|Beta 32.0]]
'''Beta 49.0''' reworked [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Artifacts#Will Will], a requirement to effectively use this. As such, Useless Bird was reworked (among a couple other Disarmed monsters). While its stats remained the same, its new effect is a combination of both Taunt and Transparency (of which the former doesn't work until the latter goes away).

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP:
* 3 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 31.0, Current)
Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Disarmed. Magic: Add to your hand 2 random ...
** other Disarmed monsters (except Chara). (Post Beta 30.0)
** '''[Chara rework]''' (Post Beta 31.2)
** other Disarmed monsters. (Post Beta 32.0)
* Taunt. Transparency.

Rarity: White (Common)
